    "text": "<p>When a capacitor is fully charged as shown in the following figure, then current drawn from the cell is</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/9e6da9e7-b415-4494-b2d5-5afaa5c11870-image.png\" style=\"width: 230px; height: 156px;\" /></p>",
